      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Text A scores a 9 for professional suitability and 8 for perceived authority due to its precise language and formal structure. Text B scores a 3 for professional suitability and 2 for perceived authority because its colloquial phrasing undermines executive credibility. Both drafts effectively cover the core topics, but Text A aligns with expectations for a Board of Directors meeting.",
